    "summary": "- Invoices get `number` (\"INV-000001\", ...) from a per-organization counter at creation. Every invoice answer shows it, because the API view embeds the invoice. The counter is saved in snapshot v3. Version 1 and 2 files are numbered in creation order on load, and new invoices continue after the highest number.\n- Save writes version 3 atomically (temp file in the same folder, then rename, no leftover). `snapshot.Upgrade(path)` writes a byte-for-byte `\u003cpath\u003e.v\u003cN\u003e.bak` and rewrites v1/v2 as v3. A v3 file is left alone. A version newer than 3 returns `ErrUnsupportedVersion` from both Load and Upgr\n...[truncated]",
